        "Content": "Overview KW Team Castles are delighted to present Apartment 38, Block D, Boden Heath, Ballyboden , Rathfarnham to the market.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the first floor within this mature and highly regarded development, this exceptional two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment is presented in true turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nEnjoying a bright, south-facing orientation, the property features generous proportions, excellent natural light, views of the mountains, and a  private outdoor balcony overlooking the landscaped central green.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\nTurnkey Condition: Extensively upgraded and maintained to an exceptional standard throughout.\r\nB2 BER Rating: High energy efficiency qualifying buyers for discounted Green Mortgage rates.\r\nGenerous 77 sq. m Layout: Well-balanced floor plan featuring both a separate utility room and a dedicated walk-in storage room.\r\nLuxury Spa Bathroom: Newly renovated with a walk-in rainfall shower, glass screen, backlit circular LED mirror, floating vanity, and bespoke slatted timber panelling.\r\nHigh-Spec Fitted Kitchen: Modern cabinetry featuring  Neff oven, Bosch induction hob, extractor fan, integrated Bosch fridge-freezer, and Bosch dishwasher.\r\nOpen-Plan Living: Light-filled living and dining space with an acoustic timber accent wall and full-height Rationel timber glazing.\r\nTwo Private Balconies: South-facing private balcony with open green and mountain views, plus a second private balcony off the primary bedroom.\r\nUpgraded Flooring: High-grade laminate wood flooring fitted seamlessly through the hallway, living area, and bedrooms.\r\nParking: One designated parking space included, with ample visitor parking throughout the development.\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: High-grade laminate wood flooring, recessed lighting, and access to all principal rooms.\r\nUtility Room: Separate, plumbed utility room providing dedicated laundry and storage space.\r\nStorage Room: Separate walk-in storage room for clutter-free living.\r\nLiving / Dining Room: Bright south-facing reception space with acoustic timber wall panelling and full-height Rationel glazed doors to the main balcony.\r\nKitchen: Contemporary fitted kitchen with ample counter space and integrated Bosch/Neff appliances.\r\nPrimary Bedroom: Spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, private ensuite shower room, and direct access to its own private balcony.\r\nEnsuite: Fully tiled contemporary bathroom with walk-in shower and modern sanitary ware.\r\nBedroom 2: Generous double bedroom, ideal for guests, family, or a dedicated home-office setup.\r\nMain Bathroom: Spa-inspired bathroom suite featuring a walk-in rainfall shower, floating vanity unit, backlit circular LED mirror, and fluted timber accents.\r\nLocation & Amenities\r\n\r\nConvenience: Local retail and convenience stores are a 2-minute walk away, with Knocklyon, Rathfarnham, Nutgrove, and Dundrum Town Centre all within easy reach.\r\nParks & Leisure: Minutes from Marlay Park, St. Enda’s Park, and mountain trails at Ticknock and Tibradden Woods.\r\nPublic Transport: Excellent connections via the 15 (24-hour service), 15B, 74, and S8 bus routes.\r\nRoad Network: Rapid connectivity to the M50 motorway (Junction 12) within two minutes.\r\nViewing strictly by appointment only through KW Team Castles."
      },
